[ti:Day 01]

[00:00.00]chamber 例 He took his seat in an unobserved corner of the chamber. 他在会议室一个不为人注意的角 落坐下了。
[00:08.34]complexion 例 If the fiscal risks can't be prevented efficiently, the tragedy complexion would result, and the social system and economic order should be restructured. 如果财政风险不 能有效防范，将会出现灾难性的局面，使得社会 制度和经济秩序必须重组。
[00:30.29]compress 例 My goal with time management is to effectively compress, organise and prioritise activities for maximum efficiency. 我的时间管 理目标是有效地压缩、组织和优先排序事宜以达 到最高效率。
[00:47.14]resourceful 例 She is a clever and resourceful manager. 她 是个聪敏机灵、足智多谋的经理。
[00:54.25]expertise 例 The business consultant that we really need is someone who can offer expertise in business logic. 我们真正需要的业务顾问是在业 务方面可以提供专业意见的人。
[01:08.48]advent 例 People's lives were greatly changed by the advent of computers. 电脑的出现极大地改变了 人们的生活。
[01:17.91]mull 例 As you mull all these things over, inspiration will strike you. 当你对整个过程深思 熟虑时，灵感就会迸发出来。
[01:26.87]wrongheaded 例 The proposal to develop a new market in the small city was proven to be a wholly wrongheaded idea. 在这座小城开拓新市场的提 议被证明是完全错误的。
[01:41.09]cultivate 例 To increase the income of farmers in our country, we should encourage them to cultivate this new variety of rice. 为增加我们国 家农民的收入，我们应该鼓励他们栽种这个新的 大米品种。
[01:57.17]safeguard 例 The union has taken measures to safeguard the interests of its members. 工会已采取措施来 保护会员们的利益。
[02:07.99]fruitful 例 The work will be more fruitful under this program. 通过运行这一程序，这份工作将变得更 加富有成效。
[02:15.88]menace 例 The careless staff are a menace to a whole team. 漫不经心的员工对整个团队来说是危险 的。
[02:22.99]comprehensive 例 This discovery prompted consumer groups, as well as scientists, to push for comprehensive testing of the potential allergenicity of GM foods. 这一发现促使消费者 团体和科学家来推动对转基因食物的潜在过敏性 进行更加全面的测试。
[02:43.86]loan 例 If we could get a loan, the company would keep going. 如果我们能争取到贷款，公司就能维 持下去。
[02:51.28]cannibalise 例 It becomes necessary to cannibalise unsuccessful projects to fund those which can proceed. 当务之急是将不成功项目中的资金抽调 出来以支持那些可行的项目。
[03:05.19]confine 例 Please confine your remarks to the subject we are debating. 请你将话题限制在我们正在谈 论的主题上。
[03:14.15]deteriorate 例 Working conditions in the factory continue to deteriorate. 工厂的工作条件持续恶化。
[03:23.89]backup 例 The backup system is an essential part of your work. 这个备份系统是你工作必不可少的部 分。
[03:31.62]banknote 例 At present, the banking system does not have enough banknotes to meet all the residents' requests. 目前，银行系统没有足够的 纸币来满足所有居民的需求。
[03:45.84]ally 例 Common interests allied these two banks with each other. 共同的利益使这两家银行结成了 联盟。
[03:54.04]commission 例 The report was submitted to the commission for its consideration. 这份报告已呈 报委员会审批。
[04:04.39]acquiesce 例 The department manager acquiesced in his demand for a higher salary. 部门经理默许了他 的加薪要求。
[04:14.91]convert 例 Another approach is to suppress anger and then convert it. 另一种方法是压制愤怒，并转变 这种愤怒。
[04:23.72]cartel 例 The cartel exists to protect its members from market retribution. 那家联合企业存在的理 由就是保护它的成员免受市场的惩罚。
[04:33.46]valid 例 The building lease is valid for six months. 这份房屋租赁合同有效期为六个月。
[04:39.95]overpay 例 I am worried that the government will overpay the shareholders at the banks. 我担心 政府会多付钱给银行股东。
[04:51.08]emphasis 例 We should lay enough emphasis on the needs and demands of current customers. 我 们应该充分重视现有顾客的需求。
[05:02.36]corner 例 They saw the great opportunity to corner the market and earned a lot of money. 他们看 准了垄断市场的大好时机，赚了很多钱。
[05:13.34]costume 例 The costume advertisements in Paris broadened his outlook. 巴黎的服装广告使他大 开眼界。
[05:22.46]capitalise 例 The firm is seeking to capitalise on technological innovations, reduce costs and become strongly competitive. 那家企业正试图 利用技术革新积累资本、降低成本，从而提高市 场竞争力。
[05:38.84]probe 例 He has been probing for the information relevant to business management. 他一直在查 找与商务管理相关的材料。
[05:49.36]obligate 例 The current accounting rules do not obligate companies to report their estimated retiree benefit expenses. 现行的会计准则没有强 迫公司汇报其退休福利预算。
[06:04.97]continent 例 Natural disasters have obviously contributed to the continent's economic crisis. 很显然，自然灾害是造成该洲经济危机的原因之 一。
[06:17.49]vindicate 例 The decision to develop new products was vindicated when the sales increased greatly. 产品销量大增证明了研发新产品这一决定的正确 性。
[06:30.32]complex 例 Those same companies are investing heavily to create a cyber-industrial complex. 同一批企业正在大力投资，创造一个网络产业综 合体。
[06:42.38]mobilise 例 No power can any longer mobilise its armed forces in secret. 现在任何一个大国都不 可能再秘密地动员其武装力量了。
[06:51.50]conservative 例 At a conservative estimate, the company will be earning up to 1 billion dollars this year. 据保守估计，这家公司今年将获利10亿美元。
[07:05.10]dollar-denominated 例 In order to prevent devaluation of their dollars, they have no option but to keep buying yet more dollar-denominated securities. 为了阻止手中的美元贬值，他们除了 购买更多以美元计价的证券，别无选择。
[07:24.89]monotony 例 To avoid monotony, we must always find something innovative. 为了避免千篇一律，我们 必须经常挖掘一些有创意的东西。
[07:34.32]adjacent 例 He despised the six colleagues at the adjacent table. 他看不起邻桌的六位同僚。
[07:42.66]illuminate 例 Doing so can make it easier to illuminate several important aspects of consumer behaviour. 这样做可以更轻松地阐明消费者行为 的几个重要方面。
[07:56.27]mint 例 I have a friend working in the German Mint. 我有个朋友在德国造币厂工作。
[08:02.45]fraught 例 The security situation has indeed been fraught with peril. 这里的安全形势确实充满危 险。
[08:11.42]enact 例 The new law is enacted by the government to regulate the market. 为了规范市场秩序，政 府颁布了新法。
[08:20.54]leviathan 例 It's truly lucky that democracy survived the Civil War with the developing industrial leviathan. 着实值得庆幸的是，民主经历了伴随着 庞大工业体系逐步兴起的内战后仍然留了下来。
[08:34.91]correspondence 例 Our correspondence is limited to a few commercial letters. 我们之间的通信仅限于几封
[08:44.96]alienate 例 The old gentleman was determined to alienate all of his property to charity upon his decease. 老先生决定死后将全部遗产转让给慈善 机构。
[08:58.41]attorney 例 For more information about setting up a business, contact a qualified attorney. 想得到 更多有关创业的信息，请和有资质的律师取得联 系。
[09:10.31]cargo 例 The crew lashed down the cargo on the fore deck. 船员们把前甲板上的货物捆牢了。
[09:17.27]dispense 例 The host required the experts to dispense with their prepared speeches and enter directly into discussion. 主办方要求专家们跳过 事先准备好的演讲，直接进入讨论阶段。
[09:32.73]dissipate 例 The pace of domestic economic recovery would slow down because the effects of rebuilding stocks overseas will dissipate eventually. 由于海外股市重建的影响终将消失， 国内经济复苏的步伐也将放缓。
[09:51.74]cynical 例 The enormous difficulty makes him cynical
